{"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set Sail on the Seas!</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/1_SetSailontheSeas.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Are you ready to embark on an epic journey starting from scratch in the middle of the ocean? Buy bigger boats, upgrade your ships, and build a unique fishing empire in the depths of the ocean. Remember: more fish means more gold!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing and Upgrades :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/2_FishingAndUpgrades.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Enjoy the thrill of fishing with just a click of a button! But it doesn\u2019t end there\u2014head to the upgrade section to increase your fish-catching capacity with each click and take your fishing skills to the next level.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f Gain Experience and Evolve :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/3_GainExperienceAndEvolve.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Every moment spent in the ocean makes you a more experienced fisherman. Thanks to the XP system, you can enhance your ships and skills, allowing you to purchase bigger and more impressive vessels while expanding your fishing empire.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udea4 Over 15 Advanced Ships :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/4_Over15AdvancedShips.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Choose from more than 15 advanced ships with unique features and capacities. Bigger ships let you catch more fish and multiply your earnings.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2699\ufe0f Unique Ship Upgrades and Levels :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/5_UniqueShipUpgradesAndLevels.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Each ship comes with its own upgrade and level system. As you enhance your ships, you\u2019ll not only increase the speed of fishing but also boost the value of each fish caught. Every upgrade takes you one step further!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcb0 Trade with Auctions :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/6_TradeWithAuctions.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Experience the excitement of selling your fish! Use the auction system to offer your catch at the right time to earn maximum profit. Make strategic decisions to trade and grow your wealth.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf05 Relaxing and Stunning Graphics :</h2></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449840/extras/7_RelaxingAndStunningGraphics.gif?t=1745419103\" /><br>Fisher Idle doesn\u2019t just offer fun mechanics; it also brings cozy and stunning visuals. Enjoy the beauty of the seas in a relaxing atmosphere while immersing yourself in the world of the game. Every detail is meticulously designed for a peaceful and entertaining experience.<br><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449840/397c25dd958911d9ad14f539b52ca6e27b4a69d6.jpg"},{"name":"First Income","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449840/07d2594b1cbc15dc59d33df1fd9989ddd8c68955.jpg"},{"name":"New Ship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449840/7ca865d3cba03b16ff43b005a8e4deb20d0a885a.jpg"},{"name":"Big Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449840/6215dd7cce4df1aca23b7ea459aee7c20aaf91fa.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.